{{#is_alert}}
**{{product.name}} carries active CISA KEV exposure and an EOL Risk Score of {{value}}/100.**

CISA lists actively exploited vulnerabilities for this product. Any of its release lines past end of life no longer gets the vendor's regular security updates, so the next exploited CVE against such a line may never be fixed. Check which of your versions are past end of life on the product page below.

- Verified exploited-and-unpatchable entries: https://endoflife.ai/exploited-and-unpatchable
- Product lifecycle detail: https://endoflife.ai/{{product.name}}
- What to do: treat as a priority migration; until then apply compensating controls (segmentation, monitoring, restricted access).
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_recovery}}
{{product.name}} has dropped below the elevated-risk threshold.
{{/is_recovery}}

Methodology: https://endoflife.ai/risk-score
